# Uncorking releases the compressed gas
# Expectation: Opening an acid/carbonate vessel should restore ambient gas pressure and account for vented gas without losing sodium/chloride.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
seal v1 10mL
add v1 NaHCO3 0.001mol
add v1 HCl 0.002mol
open v1
measure v1 pressure
inspect v1
